   "body_html": "@corro the default copy constructor is shallow copy(<code>memcpy</code>), but it failes if the Classes have Pointers or some other resources inside, therefore it is to be used with care. furthermore, it is encouraged that if you aint going to implement a copy/assignment you should implement a private empty one to prevent anyone of using the default shallow copy"
  },
